{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Setting up an Xcode project that uses MapLibre Native for iOS."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Create-a-new-iOS-project","type":"heading","text":"Create a new iOS project"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a new (SwiftUI) iOS project with Xcode. Go to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Project…","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Add-MapLibre-Native-as-a-dependency","type":"heading","text":"Add MapLibre Native as a dependency"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MapLibre Native for iOS is available on "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and on the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" (for use with the Swift Package Manager). However, for this guide we will add the MapLibre Native as a package dependency directly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In Xcode, right click your project and select “Add Package Dependencies…”:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png","type":"image"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paste the following URL and click Add Package:"}]},{"syntax":null,"code":["https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"],"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" repository only exists for distributing the iOS package of MapLibre Native. To report issues and ask questions, use the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" repository.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Verify you can import MapLibre in your app:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import MapLibre"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","text":"SwiftUI"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use MapLibre with SwiftUI we need to create a wrapper for the UIKit view that MapLibre provides (using UIViewRepresentable. The simplest way to implement this protocol is as follows:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct SimpleMap: UIViewRepresentable {","    func makeUIView(context _: Context) -> MLNMapView {","        let mapView = MLNMapView()","        return mapView","    }","","    func updateUIView(_: MLNMapView, context _: Context) {}","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use this view directly in a SwiftUI View hierarchy, for example:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            SimpleMap().edgesIgnoringSafeArea(.all)","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When running your app in the simulator you should be greeted with the default "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" style:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png","type":"image"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"UIKit","type":"heading","text":"UIKit"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use the following "},{"code":"UIViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to get started with MapLibre Native iOS with UIKit."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class SimpleMap: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad(